    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Coronary heart disease contributes to the development of angina and heart attacks and is the leading cause of death in both the developed and developing world.  An epidemic rise in its incidence has recently been noted in the developing world. Changing lifestyles with urbanisation is considered to be a key factor for this change.",
